# JulineMart Gifts — Active Build Plan

**Full doc:** `docs/julinemart-gifts-roadmap.md`

**Positioning:** Gifting **layer** on the existing marketplace — not a separate shop.

**Pilot consolidation hub:** **Warri** (`gift_fulfilment_centres`, `is_default = true`).

**Admin must be able to add/edit/deactivate consolidation hubs** — never hard-code a single city in app logic.

## Current priority — Phase G6 (JulineMart Gifts)

### Phase G6 — IN PROGRESS
- BYO personalisation via existing `product_customisation_schemas`
- Customisation on packing checklist + ops UI

### Phase G5 — COMPLETE (code)
- Delivery date validation, occasion date, secret sender

### Phase G4 — IN PROGRESS
- Homepage "Gifts for Every Moment" rail
- Full `/gifts` landing with occasion, recipient, budget filters
- SEO occasion routes (`/gifts/birthday`, etc.)
- JLO admin box tagging (occasion + recipient) — desktop + mobile

### Phase G3 — COMPLETE
- Build your own box at `/gifts/build`

### Phase G2 — COMPLETE
- Gift ops dashboard, printable card, customer timeline

### Phase G1 — COMPLETE
- Ready-made gift boxes (Mode A)
- Admin `/admin/gift-boxes`
- PWA `/gifts`, checkout with recipient + message

### Phase G0 — COMPLETE
- Warri seed hub + admin-managed `gift_fulfilment_centres`
- Gift pool + `gift_eligible` products
- Admin `/admin/gift-fulfilment-centres`

**Exit gate:** second hub addable without deploy; 30+ Warri pool SKUs; marketplace checkout unchanged.

## Phase sequence (do not skip exit gates)

| Phase | Focus |
|-------|--------|
| G0 | Warri hub + admin hubs + gift pool + eligibility |
| G1 | Ready-made gift boxes (Mode A) |
| G2 | Ops dashboard, packing, card print, gift timeline |
| G3 | Build your own box (Mode B) + running total |
| G4 | Homepage, `/gifts` landing, discovery filters, SEO |
| G5 | Delivery scheduling, secret sender |
| G6 | Personalisation — **reuse Phase 4** `product_customisation_schemas` |
| G7 | Surprise Me, corporate, QR loop, multi-hub routing, AI |

## Reuse — do not rebuild

- `orders`, Paystack, `create-order` patterns → extend with `order_kind` + `gift_orders`
- JulineMart Custom (Phase 4) for personalisation in G6
- JulineMart Protect, returns/disputes patterns
- JLO logistics after pack complete

## Do not

- Expose full marketplace catalog in gift builder
- Create duplicate `product_customisation_fields` (use Phase 4 schemas)
- Promise delivery dates without server-side validation (G5)
- Split gift orders into per-vendor customer shipments — consolidate at GFC

## Repo ownership

- **PWA:** `/gifts`, builder UX, homepage rail, gift checkout recipient UI
- **JLO:** GFC admin, pool, gift APIs, ops dashboard, migrations
- **Vendor portal:** gift programme opt-in (after G0)
